{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55050","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 八 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"内卦我，外卦属他邦。\n内尅外时无大损（辛本、川本作「攒捷」），子孙发动急旋（辛本、川本作「施」）张，大战我军强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}